        "subject": "LU-930 doc: fix outdated and dead URLs",
        "message": "LU-930 doc: fix outdated and dead URLs\n\nSwitch the remaining http:// lustre.org links in README to https://.\n\nPoint links whose hosts have moved or gone away at their current\nlocation: OpenZFS and DKMS on GitHub, the CRUSH paper on ceph.io,\nand Oracle's copy of the Sun GSS-API guide.\n\nDrop the links to the FID interoperability design page, which no\nlonger exists; the relevant parts are in the lustre_fid.h comment.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5.5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I87fdf6c67c631675dbe00acce8de873fb6eae33e\n"
